                                "sense_id": "664d4bde-3fa5-3b63-81d1-049983008204",
                                "text": "It was a joy to snatch some brief respite, and find himself in the rectory drawing–room. Listening here was as pleasant as talking; just to watch was pleasant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a57ae1ad-8194-4d68-bb02-dae4566aeef9",
                                "sense_id": "664d4bde-3fa5-3b63-81d1-049983008204",
                                "text": "1864–65, Anthony Trollope, Can You Forgive Her?\nHe did not himself care for the loose little talkings, half flat and half sharp, of men when they meet together in idleness."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
